cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Constellation: candidate-routed LLM control with deterministic reconstruction for document hierarchy parsing (code and results)"
authors:
  - family-names: "Yan"
    given-names: "XiuJian"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/1911342723/Constellation"
abstract: >-
  Code, evaluation scripts and per-document results for a document hierarchy
  parser in which deterministic providers extract ordered blocks with typed
  evidence, an LLM only votes on candidate headings over a sparse view, a
  constrained decoder fuses both, and closure assigns the original blocks to
  disjoint sections. Includes the frozen Comp-HRDoc evaluation (admission,
  development/test split, one record per document and system, bootstrap
  report) and the scripts that regenerate every reported number. Tags
  ijdar-frozen, ijdar-perf and ijdar-layout mark the evaluated code versions.
keywords:
  - document hierarchy parsing
  - large language models
  - PDF
  - DOCX
  - Comp-HRDoc
